sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Analyst
    participant Agent as AI Agent
    participant DNS as DoH Resolver
    participant TI as Threat Intel DB

    Analyst->>Agent: Request IP attribution
    Agent->>DNS: Query PTR record
    DNS-->>Agent: Return hostname
    Agent->>TI: Query reputation and ASN
    TI-->>Agent: Return score and category
    Agent->>Analyst: Present structured report
